            "detailed_description": "Somewhere, in some town that may be unknown to all; there was Tarim, a sad but strong hermitthat without knowing it or be waiting for it would be forced by itself to enter on a great adventure to save to the town of his childhood, a town without stains and that never had known the fear.<br>Tarim is a adventure of action and rol with a campaign about a hero, Tarim and the story about how he saved his people and the sacrifices he had to make it.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2 Great characters to play with<br></li><li> Leveling Up to be stronger<br></li><li> Levels set and carefully developed to achieve a desired gaming experience.<br></li><li> Fight with unique bosses.<br></li><li> Lots of enemies all of them with different features.<br></li><li> 2 Big chapters available to play.<br></li><li> Tons of unlockable items.</li></ul>",
