                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First of all, iam quite confused about this game, the sound effects and music are fucking amazing and create an amazing atmosphere.\ngraphic is very smooth and blocky at the same time; looks absolutely fabulous.\nPuzzles are quite challenging but not over the top.\nController support is great.\n\nBUT there are just some things that make me wonder:\n\nFighting is totaly weird, trying to hit an enemy with your basic strike is super hard because hitboxes are not as big as the enemy sprite.\nFurther more, you cannot fight without getting hit because most enemy strikes are undodgable so even if you try, you cant go flawless.\n \nUI is a little bit too big, rather show money, LvL, keys in a different kind of menu.\n\nStory is kind of not exsisting?!\n\nIntro is horrificly ugly and the letter appearing sound is way too loud.\nTextboxes are ugly.\n\nItems dont tell their effect. (supposed to be like that?)\n\n2. Character is not introduced and has no real point?!\n\nTutorial cuts off / seems like unfinished\n\nIf all those things are fixed/improved it might actualy be a very nice and entertaining game, which it is already but... meh those negative ones are just not necessary.",
